<title>USA: Wall Street stocks up slightly in early trade.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks up slightly in early trade.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Wall Street stocks were up slightly in early trading on Monday with the Dow Industrials and Nasdaq Composite fighting the undertow of a weak bond market and moving higher.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials were up two at 6698 and the Nasdaq Composite was up four at 1369.</p>
